WEBVTT

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.000
What? You've never heard of Joe!?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.300
You must be new here!

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.470
Yeah. Sorry 'bout that.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.290
Joe, do your best!

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.690
Kick Wolf's ass!

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.980
C'mon! Get him!

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.940
Hey, look here! Our very own Joe got a big article!

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.660
Damn, Joe's lookin' pretty manly there, ain't he!?

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.800
Whatever, I'm just impressed he made it big!

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.630
You're right! S'amazing!

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.530
Hey, old man, I thought you couldn't read!

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:29.010
This is the first time I've ever bought a newspaper!

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:33.120
But it's a newspaper with Joe in it!

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.800
Gimme one with as much about Joe as you can!

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:39.850
Thank you for your custom!

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:01.860
Bro Joe's finally got his bout with Wolf...

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.320
but he doesn't look happy about it.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:09.330
Not only that, old man Danpei and Mammoth look nervous for some reason.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.840
I hear it's because there's something wrong with his Cross Counter...

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:15.340
Ow!

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.260
You... idiot!

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:16.900
You... idiot!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.140
Hyoromatsu, you idiot!

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.490
You dare doubt Joe's Cross Counter!?

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:23.290
Joe's Cross Counter is invincible...

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.350
Right?

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.850
Hey, Chief...

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:14.050
How long are you going to keep Yabuki-kun doing jump rope and hitting the punch bag?

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.360
Wolf's doing secret training for the sole purpose of defeating Yabuki-kun!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.740
You'll have to think up a strategy to counteract that...

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:22.630
No kidding. I hear he's trying to counter the Cross Counter...

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.640
Whatever you decide to do, make it flashy!

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.850
Come on. Won't you do anything new?

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.910
Wolf's turfed the media out of his secret training sessions.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.680
And here you guys are, doing the same old things.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.420
Seriously, how can we make an article outta this?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.420
Will you all just leave us alone!?

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.280
You keep bothering us about our strategy,

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.390
but how can we formulate a plan when we don't even know theirs?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:54.960
Joe, it's time.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.830
Joe, it's time.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.150
Yeah.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:02.940
Man, oh, man...

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.520
That punch bag again?

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.760
Hey, we should call it a day.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:07.410
Yeah, sure.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.640
Well, thanks for letting us watch!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:10.790
Take care!

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:13.580
Take care!

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.790
No story today, I guess.

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.300
But with the wild brawler in this state...

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:24.300
Guess he'll end up just caving in to Wolf.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.800
You bastard! Don't say that or it'll happen!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:29.310
Bro Joe would never lose to Wolf!

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:30.810
Kill them!

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.550
Take that!

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.640
Stop! Stop!

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:41.800
Stop, I said!

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.680
If you have time to mess around,

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.170
then follow me!

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:48.990
F-Follow you? Follow you where?

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.910
Oh, I forgot. The fare.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.450
Hey, any of you have enough for train fare?

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:54.780
Fare?

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.420
You mean money?

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.420
Right, I guess there's nothing for it.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.510
Go borrow some.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:06.120
Borrow?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.050
From who?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.550
Isn't that obvious?

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:17.020
Th-This is why I didn't want to come here...

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.600
If only Wolf was allowing reporters in...

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.600
<i>Hey, Mister!</i>

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:22.940
Huh!?

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:27.730
Bastard!

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.150
I got a camera!

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:36.750
I got his whole wallet!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.090
So, Tarou-chan, where are we heading?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.080
You'll find out when we get there.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:51.180
Can't you read the sign?

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:54.140
Oh, come on. Can't you have a word on our behalf?

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:55.970
Get outta here right now!

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.700
But we won't disturb his training!

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.490
No can do.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:04.300
Coach Otaka ordered us to make sure that even the rats are kept out until the match is over.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.490
No means no!

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:07.970
All right! You don't have to yell at us!

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.360
Tarou-chan, isn't this Asia Gym?

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:15.890
What are we gonna do here?

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:16.620
Don't be so loud!

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:20.620
You sure are dumb! Don't you get what we're gonna do?

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:24.630
Long story short, we're gonna spy on Wolf's secret training!

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.630
Spy?

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:28.130
Spy!?

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:29.710
Spy!?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.730
Can't get in through the back door...

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:48.020
The emergency staircase is a no-go, too...

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:57.750
Let's not. This trash heap's as bad as any guard!

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.010
All right! We're going this way!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:00.540
You're kidding...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.590
This stinks...

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:05.210
This sounded cooler in theory...

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.550
What are you talking about? This is for Joe's sake!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.230
We'd do anything for him, no question!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:11.880
We didn't <i>have</i> to wade through trash, though...

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:16.050
Sachi's fine with it because she has special feelings for Bro Joe...

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.160
Huh? What does "special feelings" mean?

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.930
Hey! Shut up already!

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.970
Listen. Don't make a sound.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:24.980
Okay.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:37.660
Whoops.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.890
Hide! Somebody's coming!

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.890
It hurts so bad!

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.170
Hang in there! We're almost at the infirmary!

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.860
It hurts!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.660
Doc! He's all yours!

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:23.960
Again? That's the third one today!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.990
What kind of training is he doing, anyway?

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.870
That's not important! Please tend to him!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.750
O-Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.360
D-Did you see that?

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:36.430
W-Wolf did that to him! Wolf was training with that guy!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:53.330
Guys! If we follow the trail of blood, we'll end up at Wolf's training room!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.110
Let's go!

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:11.090
S-Sounds pretty intense...

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.430
So this is the secret training that's making Joe and the old man sweat...

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.040
Let's take a look...

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.820
That's the way, Wolf! Just like that!

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:25.370
Now, finish him off!

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.190
Elbow! Your elbow! Use your elbow!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.350
Dammit, someone's standing in front of the door!

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.320
I-I wanna see, too!

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.100
Me too!

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.230
Don't push, you idiots!

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:38.610
Me too!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:38.610
<i>Stop pushing!</i>

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:46.410
Stop practicing, Wolf! We got rats!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.980
No wonder you look familiar!

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:08.140
You're Yabuki Joe's little friends!

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.260
Yabuki's?

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.570
Sending kids to spy on us...

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.580
Yabuki's more pitiful than I thought.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.980
Y-You're wrong! Bro Joe doesn't know we're here!

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:31.340
We came here of our own free will... Ouch!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.920
Well, it doesn't matter to me, either way.

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:40.340
The problem is that you've trespassed somewhere you shouldn't be.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.520
Couldn't sleep, old man?

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.630
Looks like you couldn't either.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.820
Whatever.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:30.850
If I oversleep, my head feels fuzzy!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.230
Don't try and act tough.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:37.730
You're the one whose eyes were wide open last night.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.110
What are you saying!?

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.660
Are you suggesting I'm worried about Wolf's secret training!?

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.660
I couldn't give a crap about that!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.040
I never said anything about Wolf.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.920
You're the one who brought him up.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.330
This is all so damn pathetic!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:04.010
I can't believe that fleabag Wolf has got you running scared.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.430
Let me be frank.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.640
I'm disappointed in Tange Gym!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:16.650
I should've joined Shiraki Gym when I had the chance!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.860
Some chairman you are. Some coach you are.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:26.310
Have you actually coached me on anything since the fight date was set?

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:28.880
Well, this time I picked the fight.

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:32.090
I never needed your help to begin with.

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:35.570
At least stop acting like you're scared shitless, okay?

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:38.110
Just watch me.

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:40.140
Watch me with confidence.

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.410
I mean...

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:43.450
You and Nishi are shaking in your boots, for chrissake.

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:46.200
For the past few days, whenever I've caught sight of your pale face,

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.010
I've started getting down in the dumps, too!

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.210
I don't even feel like hitting that sandbag anymore!

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:52.330
Listen!

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:55.810
Wolf is nothing to me!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.750
Don't worry. Under no circumstances will I lose to him.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.190
So, just relax and go do some day laboring or something.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:04.240
That'll help my training more than anything!

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:19.390
Those were some pretty harsh words.

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:21.430
I know it's pathetic,

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:24.530
but I have no response to that.

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:54.790
I may well be useless as a chairman.

00:14:55.350 --> 00:15:00.000
You and Nishi are like golden eggs of talent,

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.920
and I've always been afraid that I'll sully your sheen...{TC: had to take out the "eggs" bit because of logic error (gold doesn't go rusty) but I think this is a suitable equivalent}

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:07.360
But I'm doing the best I can.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:10.010
From your point of view, I may be a worthless coach,

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.740
but I've tried to train you and Nishi...

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:15.040
with more passion than any coach ever could!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:17.380
I'm sorry.

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.140
I got it wrong, old man.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.770
So don't lecture me like that.

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:24.400
There's something wrong with me.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.050
I said some really horrible things back there...

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:28.030
There's no need to apologize.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:30.450
Now I'm not saying this out of spite,

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.030
but it's not too late for you.

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:35.870
Why don't you go to Shiraki Gym and prepare for your match with Wolf?

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.580
I can even ask Shiraki-san for you.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.200
Drop it. I'm apologizing, aren't I?

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:46.590
I want you to forget everything I said.

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:50.320
For someone who says things that tear my heart out...

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:52.070
you're pretty wimpy, aren't you?

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:54.930
Don't worry about me. You can start all over again.

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.140
I said drop it!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:58.630
You just won't stop talking, will you?

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:01.260
If I really was disappointed by your coaching,

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.320
I wouldn't be here telling you to stop talking! I would've left long ago!

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.280
I know, I know.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.810
Let's forget all about it.

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:15.590
More importantly, the day's galloping on. We should start thinking of a strategy to beat Wolf.

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:17.850
Yeah.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.830
Old man, what do you think about Wolf's secret training?

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:30.020
I know it sounds obvious, but he's found a way to counter your Cross Counter.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:32.660
That's why he's so confident.

00:16:33.140 --> 00:16:35.310
Yeah, that's what I think, too.

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:38.170
And the way I see it,

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:40.850
I reckon Wolf is gonna try to block me from using the Cross Counter.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.810
You think so, too?

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.270
You think that too, old man?

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:51.440
Thing is, the Cross Counter...

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:55.940
The Cross Counter is thrown when your opponent throws a straight left.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:17:00.910
You cross your arm over theirs, and 
because of the principles of leverage,

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:03.920
its power is doubled or even quadrupled.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.670
Which means that the Cross can only exist...

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.570
once the opponent has thrown a straight left.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.070
Which means...

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:11.070
Perhaps...

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.090
Perhaps...

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:18.600
If your opponent never throws a single straight left...

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.000
So, we were thinking the same thing.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:28.110
Well, if you noticed that, then you can hardly be called worthless. You're a great coach.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:34.080
Oh, come off it! Don't start bragging now!

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.030
Wh-What?

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:46.720
Wolf won't throw a single straight left?

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:48.080
If that's true...

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.090
Joe's Cross Counter will misfire!

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:54.520
It'll just be a pointless, ineffective punch.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:02.140
I guess being beaten because I'm a stupid one-trick pony...

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.100
makes me plain stupid!

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.980
That's enough, Joe. There's no time for that.

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:29.540
But what should we do?

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.800
What should we throw in place of the Cross Counter?

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:34.330
Yo! I'll throw a straight left.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.920
I'll throw a straight left!

00:18:46.090 --> 00:18:48.350
I'll throw a straight left.

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.780
Gotta say, I'm impressed at how hard you're training so early in the morning.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.560
Wolf...

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:04.280
Just now, you said you'll throw a straight left, didn't you?

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.800
That's what I said.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:09.790
It's the least I can do, when you've been training so hard even though you know you're gonna lose.

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:11.000
What?

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:12.880
Whoa, now.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:17.820
Don't thank me yet. Truth is, I've brought you some more gifts.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.580
These'll hurt a little, though.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:29.060
One!

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:33.060
Sachi!

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.070
Two!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.460
Three!

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:40.530
Four!

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:42.970
Five!

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:48.170
Sonovabitch!

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:56.840
Aren't these great gifts, Joe?

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.840
Y-You bastard. What have you done to these kids?

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:07.910
Seems they really wanted to watch me train.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:11.430
So, I got them to be my sparring partners in the ring, one at a time.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:12.940
What!?

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:14.900
When they come to, tell them this:

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.940
"Spying on me was a really bad idea, wasn't it?"

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.940
Well, see you in the ring!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.040
Hold it!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.140
Sachi...

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:46.560
Kinoko...

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:49.680
Tonkichi...

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:52.030
Tarou...

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:55.950
Hyoromatsu...

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.930
Doctor! Hurry!

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.370
Doctor! Hurry!

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:18.280
How could this happen?

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:20.540
Th-These precious little children...

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:23.520
Nishi-kun! Go boil some water!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:24.340
Y-Yes!

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:32.430
You'll pay for this...

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:34.400
Wolf...

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:35.740
I'll make you pay!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.750
I <i>will</i> make you pay!

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:03.400
All right, that's the way!

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:06.540
Don't fall behind! This is Tange Gym's first special training session!

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:09.080
If this is too much for you, you'll never beat Wolf!

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:29.910
Hey, look!

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:30.820
He's here?

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:32.350
Hey, here he comes!

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:33.830
There he is!

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:35.830
We've been waiting for you!

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.320
Go for it!

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:38.830
Kick Wolf's ass!

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:40.440
We came down to see you!

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:42.590
Go for it!

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:46.010
Goddamn... They're all Joe fans...

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:48.030
You idiot! Show some respect!

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:51.060
Don't let it get to you, Wolf.

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:54.100
A boxer's worth isn't decided by how he enters the ring!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:57.140
It's judged on whether the crowd cheers for him when he leaves it!

00:22:57.590 --> 00:22:59.150
I understand, Coach.

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:02.150
But I have absolute confidence.

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:31.980
Wh-Why are they all so bruised?

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:50.200
The bell has finally sounded.

00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:53.700
Wolf had his secret practice sessions, and Joe had his special training...

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:57.700
Who will hold his arm aloft in victory?

00:23:58.440 --> 00:24:01.760
Now, for Joe, as his stormy showdown begins,

00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:03.380
which way is tomorrow!?
